This project references the current BJUT portal protocol implementation and
public campus-network information in:

https://github.com/key-zhzr/BJUT-Auto-Login

The headless implementation is independently organized for Linux CLI/systemd
use. Portal endpoints, request parameters, protocol behavior, and the fallback
campus-address heuristic were informed by the upstream MIT-licensed project.

